# Feature: overlapping global leaves. Two global leaves overlap: "Easter" (holiday, 04-03..04-07) and "Overlap" (special, 04-06..04-08). TaskJuggler marks a person's slots on the overlap as off-hours, so the days appear in neither workingTime nor leaves (ADR-0014 amendment 2026-11-16). T9 fills those days in from the global leave list.
# Binding: ada's 15-day effort runs across the overlap; no slot may be booked on 04-06 or 04-07.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
project overlap "Overlapping leaves" 2026-03-30 - 2026-05-01 {
}

leaves holiday "Easter" 2026-04-03 - 2026-04-07
leaves special "Overlap" 2026-04-06 - 2026-04-08

resource ada "Ada"

task run "Run" {
  start 2026-03-30
  effort 15d
  allocate ada
}
